#
# Provides the CssFormatter class with static functions for generating CSS color
# string representations in hex (#RRGGBB), rgb(R, G, B), and hsl(H, S%, L%)
# formats. These output strings are valid CSS color values that can be embedded
# directly in stylesheets or inline style attributes.
